        "selector": "JSXOpeningElement[name.name='Header'] > JSXAttribute > JSXIdentifier[name!=/^(?:active|cart|messages|key|ref|className|style|children)$/]",
        "message": "<Header> doesn't accept that prop. Declared props: active, cart, messages."
